<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

  <!--
    The Mongoose's Hellfire brought in line with the Mk. 82 (0.37.0; owner's cards, 23 Nov 2026: real weights, intermediate parts;
    docs/development/aircraft-munitions.md). The item exists only under Combat Extended, so the patch waits on it. Stock, it was worth
    about 410 silver.

    AGM-114K Hellfire II: 45 kg (100 lb), a 9 kg tandem shaped charge, semi-active laser seeker (Wikipedia; designation-systems.net
    gives 45.7 kg; secondary); the author's 47 kg was near it. Its seeker is the missile seeker head (Mods/AircraftMunitions); 40 steel
    for the body and motor case, 10 FSX for the warheads and the motor's charge, 50 chemfuel for the propellant, 6 components. AUTHORED,
    from the owner's table, with the head carrying an advanced component and two of the components. About 790 silver.
  -->
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Mongoose_Ammo_HellfireMissile"]</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Mongoose_Ammo_HellfireMissile"]/costList</xpath>
          <value>
            <costList>
              <PhobosMissileSeekerHead>1</PhobosMissileSeekerHead>
              <Steel>40</Steel>
              <FSX>10</FSX>
              <Chemfuel>50</Chemfuel>
              <ComponentIndustrial>6</ComponentIndustrial>
            </costList>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Mongoose_Ammo_HellfireMissile"]/statBases/Mass</xpath>
          <value>
            <Mass>45</Mass>
          </value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
